A literal directive and a quote inside a reference link

```
[a {{ x @lines:0 }} b][r]

[r]: /r
.
<p><a href="/r">a {{ x @lines:0 }} b</a></p>
```

```
[a [b {{ x @lines:0 }}][r] c][r]

[r]: /r
.
<p><a href="/r">a b {{ x @lines:0 }} c</a></p>
```

```
[a [b "c"][r] d][r]

[r]: /r
.
<p><a href="/r">a b “c” d</a></p>
```
